  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p>It is important after a surgical weight loss procedure to follow your surgeon’s instruction to minimize the risk of complications.&nbsp; Please review the important videos below for a refresher on post-op discharge instructions and diet progression.</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n<div class=\"vc_tta-container\" data-vc-action=\"collapseAll\"><div class=\"vc_general vc_tta vc_tta-accordion vc_tta-color-sky vc_tta-style-classic vc_tta-shape-rounded vc_tta-spacing-2 vc_tta-gap-2 vc_tta-controls-align-default vc_tta-o-all-clickable\"><div class=\"vc_tta-panels-container\"><div class=\"vc_tta-panels\"><div class=\"vc_tta-panel\" id=\"1472664686874-e02969a2-46dc\" data-vc-content=\".vc_tta-panel-body\"><div class=\"vc_tta-panel-heading\"><h4 class=\"vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left\"><a href=\"#1472664686874-e02969a2-46dc\" data-vc-accordion=\"\" data-vc-container=\".vc_tta-container\"><span class=\"vc_tta-title-text\">Post-op diet and discharge instructions videos</span><i class=\"vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus\"></i></a></h4></div><div class=\"vc_tta-panel-body\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_video_widget wpb_content_element vc_clearfix   vc_video-aspect-ratio-169 vc_video-el-width-100 vc_video-align-left\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_video_heading\">Post-op Discharge Instructions</h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_video_wrapper\"><iframe title=\"Preop Teaching Video 2: Post-op Meds &amp; Activity\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DnntnQHCs3c?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"wpb_video_widget wpb_content_element vc_clearfix   vc_video-aspect-ratio-169 vc_video-el-width-100 vc_video-align-left\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_video_heading\">Post-op Diet Progression</h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_video_wrapper\"><iframe title=\"Preop Teaching Video 3: Post-op Diet Progression\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ElI_eTlMZIU?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"vc_tta-panel\" id=\"1518183734816-1bfb2bb7-d3e5\" data-vc-content=\".vc_tta-panel-body\"><div class=\"vc_tta-panel-heading\"><h4 class=\"vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left\"><a href=\"#1518183734816-1bfb2bb7-d3e5\" data-vc-accordion=\"\" data-vc-container=\".vc_tta-container\"><span class=\"vc_tta-title-text\">Lovenox/Heparin Instructions</span><i class=\"vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus\"></i></a></h4></div><div class=\"vc_tta-panel-body\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p>Not all patients are prescribed blood thinners after surgery, but if you were please review this information.&nbsp; It is important to do your injections regularly as scheduled, and finish all syringes!</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n<div class=\"vc_grid-container-wrapper vc_clearfix vc_grid-animation-fadeIn\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_grid-container vc_clearfix wpb_content_element vc_basic_grid\" data-initial-loading-animation=\"fadeIn\" data-vc-grid-settings=\"{&quot;page_id&quot;:5116,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;all&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;vc_get_vc_grid_data&quot;,&quot;shortcode_id&quot;:&quot;1583768259012-a8a70